          "source_bid": "d59f2gpg4t8g",
          "details": "從伐宋，至汴，遷棣州刺史、侍衛步軍都虞候。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8ni0xs0",
      "text": "商州刺史",
      "place_id": "hixicl8cp8ig",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《金史》卷八十一·趙隇傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gpg4t8g",
          "details": "及再伐宋，攻真定，與有功，改商州刺史，檢校尚書右僕射。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8oqz400",
      "text": "宿州防禦使",
      "place_id": "hixicl8cdzww",
      "sources": [
